[0.001, "o", "Theme: accent #2563eb · background #ffffff · surface #f8fafc · text #171717 · mutedText #64748b · border #e2e8f0 · danger #dc2626\r\nType: Geist, sans-serif · radius 8px\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "No host evidence for accent, border, danger, surface, mutedText — neutral defaults used.\r\nTheme lives in .vendo/theme.json — edit it anytime; it is the source of truth.\r\njudgment: structural-only — only protocol facts are graded, so every ungraded tool asks on each call (add a model key and run `vendo sync` to grade the catalog)\r\n"]
[0.103, "o", "No model key yet: set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY / GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY in .env.local, or run `vendo login` for a free dev key.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\nONE STEP LEFT — paste this yourself (init never edits your files)\r\n\r\n  File: app/layout.tsx\r\n    import { VendoProvider } from \"@vendoai/vendo/react\";\r\n    import theme from \"../.vendo/theme.json\";\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    import type { VendoTheme } from \"@vendoai/vendo\";\r\n    … then wrap: <VendoProvider baseUrl=\"/api/vendo\" theme={theme as VendoTheme}>{children}</VendoProvider>\r\n\r\n  <VendoProvider> is what the @vendoai/ui hooks and embeds read; baseUrl is the wire mount, path prefix included. Until this lands, Vendo is wired but nothing on the page can reach it.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Then confirm it landed: npx vendo doctor\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nVerify everything: `npx vendo doctor` (it can start the server and run a live turn).\r\n\r\nAgent tail:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  auth: clerk() wired (detected @clerk/nextjs)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  edit app/layout.tsx — wrap the app in the <VendoProvider> lines above (without it, nothing on the page can reach Vendo)\r\n  edit .vendo/brief.md — replace the placeholder with what this product does and for whom\r\n  cloud key: none — for Vendo Cloud, fetch https://vendo.run/auth.md and run `vendo login` (your human approves a code in the browser; the key lands in .env.local), then re-run init or pass --cloud-key <key>; --byo with a provider key also works\r\n  gate: run `vendo doctor --json` — done when every check reports green\r\n\r\n→ Don't forget the paste in app/layout.tsx (frame above)\r\n"]
